<title>UK: LME lists U.S. grade A copper brand.</title>
<headline>LME lists U.S. grade A copper brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has listed the CMMC ER grade A copper brand of U.S. producer Cyprus Amax Minerals Co, an Exchange notice said.</p>
<p>Cyprus Amax's smelter in Claypool, Arizona, has an annual output of 172,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The brand will consitute good delivery against the LME copper garde A contract with immediate effect, the Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8075</p>
</text>
